  "notes": "'This spell can't be countered.' is the compiler's B14 static. Damage: parse of '~ deals 5 damage to target creature or planeswalker.' (B5b-named-damage) with FOr(COLOR_HAS W, COLOR_HAS U) added to the target filter ('that's white or blue'; FOr of COLOR_HAS per MAPPER_GUIDE, Quirion Dryad). Probe: only the white/blue opposing creatures are offered."
